; Framing arm for the step-4 baseline (#127 follow-up).
;
; `generic` (plain User:/Assistant: labels), not `gemma`: geistlib's own note
; records that Gemma with an external SentencePiece does better on generic
; labels than on its native markers — the tokenizer does not map
; <start_of_turn> to control tokens 105/106, so the native template would put
; markers in the prompt the model never sees as markers.
(model_profile
  (name "gemma-generic")
  (arch "gemma")
  (template generic))
